    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20173" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλύζω</span>
			, c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόνῳ βλύουσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					301
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέμας οἱ ἔβλυεν ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					19.287
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρ᾽ ὄρει θερμῶν ὑδάτων βλύοντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					199.11
				</span></i>
			. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ</span> between two long
			syll. in 
				Ep.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνα-βλύεσκε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.223
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.1417
			</span></i>.]</div>
